        <schema:exclusion xml:lang="en">Transferring oneself</schema:exclusion>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Moving along a surface on foot, step by step, so that one foot is always on the ground, such as when strolling, sauntering, walking forwards, backwards, or sideways.</skos:definition>
